{"speciesId":466,"names":{"fr":"Élekable","es":"Electivire","en":"Electivire","ja":"エレキブル"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"It pushes the tips of its two tails against the foe, then lets loose with over 20,000 volts of power."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"It pushes the tips of its two tails against the foe, then lets loose with over 20,000 volts of power."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"Heedless of enemy attacks, it closes in, shoves its tails onto the foe, then looses high voltage."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"As its electric charge amplifies, blue sparks begin to crackle between its horns."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"As its electric charge amplifies, blue sparks begin to crackle between its horns."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Encaissant les attaques, il vient toucher l’ennemi de ses queues et lui inflige une forte décharge."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"Heedless of enemy attacks, it closes in, shoves its tails onto the foe, then looses high voltage."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Encaissant les attaques, il vient toucher l’ennemi de ses queues et lui inflige une forte décharge."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"Heedless of enemy attacks, it closes in, shoves its tails onto the foe, then looses high voltage."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"The instant it presses the tips of its tails onto an opponent, it sends over 20,000 volts of electricity into the foe."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"The instant it presses the tips of its tails onto an opponent, it sends over 20,000 volts of electricity into the foe."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Des étincelles bleuâtres jaillissent entre ses 2 cornes quand il accumule beaucoup d’électricité."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Al almacenar mucha electricidad, desprende chispas de una claridad increíble entre sus dos cuernos."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"As its electric charge amplifies, blue sparks begin to crackle between its horns."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"電気を いっぱいに ためると ２本の ツノの あいだで 激しく 青白い 火花を 散らす。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Il place le bout de ses deux queues sur son ennemi et libère une décharge de 20 000 V."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Toca a su enemigo con las puntas de sus dos colas y le suelta una descarga de más de 20 000 voltios."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"It pushes the tips of its two tails against the foe, then lets loose with over 20,000 volts of power."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"２本の 尻尾の 先を 相手に 押し当てて ２万ボルト以上の 電流を 流して 攻撃。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Des étincelles bleuâtres jaillissent entre ses 2 cornes quand il accumule beaucoup d’électricité."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Al almacenar mucha electricidad, desprende chispas de una claridad increíble entre sus dos cuernos."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"As its electric charge amplifies, blue sparks begin to crackle between its horns."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"電気を いっぱいに ためると ２本の ツノの あいだで 激しく 青白い 火花を 散らす。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Il place le bout de ses deux queues sur son ennemi et libère une décharge de 20 000 V."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Toca a su enemigo con las puntas de sus dos colas y le suelta una descarga de más de 20 000 voltios."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"It pushes the tips of its two tails against the foe, then lets loose with over 20,000 volts of power."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"２本の 尻尾の 先を 相手に 押し当てて ２万ボルト以上の 電流を 流して 攻撃。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sun","text":"Il connecte le bout de sa queue à son ennemi et libère une violente décharge. L’ennemi est instantanément grillé."},{"language":"es","version":"sun","text":"Toca a su enemigo con la punta de sus colas y le suelta una descarga de alta tensión que lo deja achicharrado al instante."},{"language":"en","version":"sun","text":"It pushes the tips of its tails against its foes and then lets loose a high-voltage current. Its foes are burned to a crisp in an instant."},{"language":"ja","version":"sun","text":"尻尾の 先を 敵に 押しつけ 高圧電流を 流し込む。 一瞬で 敵は 黒コゲ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"moon","text":"Quand il est excité, il se frappe violemment la poitrine de ses poings. Cela fait des étincelles électriques et un vrai roulement de tonnerre."},{"language":"es","version":"moon","text":"Al exaltarse, se golpea con ímpetu el pecho. Cada vez que lo hace saltan chispas y un trueno resuena por la zona."},{"language":"en","version":"moon","text":"When it gets excited, it thumps its chest. With every thud, thunder roars and electric sparks shower all around."},{"language":"ja","version":"moon","text":"興奮すると 胸を 打ち鳴らす。 そのたびに 電気火花が 散り 雷鳴が あたりに 響き渡る。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Il tient fermement le bout de sa queue pour charger son poing d’électricité, puis martèle ses ennemis de coups dévastateurs."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Agarra sus colas para electrificar los puños y luego soltar puñetazos devastadores."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"It grips its tail, which spews electricity, and then beats down opponents with the power of its electrified fist."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"電気が ほとばしるシッポを 握り 帯電した 拳を 作ると 力任せに ぶん殴る。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Il suffit d’un seul Élekable pour alimenter tous les bâtiments d’une métropole pendant un an."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"La electricidad que genera un solo Electivire es suficiente para cubrir la demanda energética de los edificios de una metrópoli durante un año."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"A single Electivire can provide enough electricity for all the buildings in a big city for a year."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"エレキブル １匹で 大都市の 建物 すべての 電力を １年分 まかなうことが できる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"La quantité d’électricité qu’il génère est proportionnelle à son pouls. Quand il livre un combat, son voltage augmente aussitôt."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"La cantidad de electricidad que genera es proporcional a su pulso. Al enzarzarse en combate, su voltaje aumenta drásticamente."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"The amount of electrical energy this Pokémon produces is proportional to the rate of its pulse. The voltage jumps while Electivire is battling."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"発電量は 心拍数と 比例する。 戦いになると 一気に ボルテージが 上がるのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"La quantité d’électricité qu’il génère est énorme, même pour un Pokémon Électrik. Il inflige de fortes décharges du bout de ses queues."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Es de los Pokémon de tipo Eléctrico que más electricidad producen. Genera una corriente de alta tensión desde las puntas de las colas."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"In terms of electrical-energy output, Electivire is one of the best among all Electric Pokémon. It discharges high-voltage currents from its tails."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"発電量は 電気ポケモン 最高クラス。 しっぽの 先から 高圧電流を 放電する。"},{"language":"en","version":"legends-arceus","text":"Its evolution was induced by an unusual item, and its electrical output rises along with its heart rate. From its tails, it can unleash an electric current measuring 20,000 volts."}],"varieties":[{"id":466,"moves":[{"name":"mega-punch","learns":[[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"fire-punch","learns":[[8,"level-up",1],[9,"level-up",1],[9,"tutor",0],[10,"level-up",1],[10,"tutor",0],[11,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",1],[14,"tutor",0],[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],[16,"tutor",0],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[18,"tutor",0],[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"ice-punch",